<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 3-mth, floater coupon T-bills Apr 25.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 3-mth, floater coupon T-bills Apr 25.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer a three-month, floater coupon T-bill issue at an auction on Friday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The coupon is set equal to the central bank's main interest rate, now set at 8.03 percent monthly, or 96.36 percent annually.</p>
<p>The issue will be offered with no par value or minimum acceptable price set in advance.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p>Issue number	   BG3030997020</p>
<p> Term		     three months</p>
<p> Auction date	   April 25</p>
<p> Issue date	     May 2</p>
<p> Maturity date	  August 1</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
